e to around 500-600 chips would:\n- Charge flush and straight draws to continue\n- Build the pot when I'm likely ahead\n- Show strength without committing my entire stack\n- Allow me to re-evaluate on the turn if called\n\nA raise to 600 represents a solid 3.4x their bet, which is standard for protection while not overcommitting.\n\nAnswer: 600"}
